                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a27fbd7-f9e0-3226-8f08-5e594bda40f8",
                        "entry_id": "4afd49e3-60a8-3488-96e7-9e56be3b75b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An adherent of communitarianism"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "79577955-1402-456a-b87b-72c7875e90b4",
                                "sense_id": "3a27fbd7-f9e0-3226-8f08-5e594bda40f8",
                                "text": "I'm a libertarian, but John here is a communitarian."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c98a806-edc7-4ba3-a260-e42a4172ddd6",
                                "sense_id": "3a27fbd7-f9e0-3226-8f08-5e594bda40f8",
                                "text": "Two of the groups involved, he said, are simply characterized: individualists (most people would call them libertarians, who want the government to butt out) and communitarians, the two poles on the political spectrum. The two other groups, he said, are called hierarchists and egalitarians."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6bb9c7c-f7ef-3243-882a-c2bcb0cac1d8",
                        "entry_id": "4afd49e3-60a8-3488-96e7-9e56be3b75b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A member of a community."
                        ],
